  "instance_name": "mapping_001",
  "label": "The man is mapped as a representative of 'most religions'",
  "description": "The textual phrase 'most religions are religions of peace' is juxtaposed with the visual of a man whose appearance (beard, head covering) is culturally associated with Muslim men. The meme implicitly maps this man as a visual representation of 'most religions' — specifically, as an exemplar of a 'religion of peace'. This mapping relies on the stereotype that 'Muslims are peaceful' and uses the man's visual identity to stand in for the abstract concept of 'religions' in general, creating a false equivalence. The mapping is formalized by projecting the textual concept 'most religions' onto the visual entity 'man'.",
